---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for mikesellsut.com — how we collect, use, and protect your information."
>
  <section class="bg-navy py-12 md:py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl text-white uppercase tracking-wide">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="h-1 bg-gold"></div>

  <section class="py-12 lg:py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-lg prose-headings:font-heading prose-headings:uppercase prose-headings:tracking-wide prose-headings:text-navy prose-p:text-navy/80 prose-li:text-navy/80">
      <p><em>Last updated: March 2026</em></p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you use the contact forms on this website, we collect the information you provide, including your name, email address, phone number, and message content. This information is submitted through Netlify Forms and stored securely on Netlify's servers.</p>

      <h2>Google Analytics</h2>
      <p>This website uses Google Analytics 4 (measurement ID: G-QMXYY3Z3FT) to understand how visitors use our site. Google Analytics collects information such as:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Pages you visit and how long you spend on them</li>
        <li>Your general geographic location (city/region level)</li>
        <li>The device and browser you use</li>
        <li>How you found our site (search engine, direct link, social media, etc.)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This data is collected anonymously and is used solely to improve our website and understand our audience. Google Analytics uses cookies to collect this information. You can opt out of Google Analytics by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>This website uses cookies for Google Analytics as described above. We do not use cookies for advertising, tracking across other websites, or any other purpose.</p>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>The personal information you provide through contact forms is used solely to respond to your inquiry about real estate services. We may use your contact information to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to your questions about buying or selling property</li>
        <li>Provide information about listings or market conditions you've asked about</li>
        <li>Follow up on your real estate inquiry</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your personal information to third parties. Your information may be shared with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Heritage Realty Group LLC (our brokerage) as required for real estate transactions</li>
        <li>Service providers who assist in operating our website (Netlify for hosting and form processing)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>We take reasonable measures to protect the information you provide. Our website is served over HTTPS, and form submissions are processed through Netlify's secure infrastructure.</p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You may contact us at any time to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Request access to the personal information we hold about you</li>
        <li>Request that we delete your personal information</li>
        <li>Ask questions about this privacy policy</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, contact us at:</p>
      <p>
        Mike Price, Heritage Realty Group LLC<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:mikesellsut@gmail.com">mikesellsut@gmail.com</a><br />
        Phone: <a href="tel:4356600401">435-660-0401</a><br />
        P.O. Box 431, Spring City, UT 84662
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
